{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","群魔之眼"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯指挥使徒控制敌人，随后对所有敌人造成高额伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯的每名使徒各选择一名敌人，眩晕目标使其无法行动，持续3.5秒，优先选择最靠前的不同敌人。随后拉曼提斯对所有敌人造成600% + 60% ATK伤害，同时使徒对被牵制的敌人施加等同于拉曼提斯20%初始生命上限的生命削减。该技能释放结束后，拉曼提斯和使徒在接下来10秒内提高60点攻击速度。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":108,"end":112,"tooltip_key":"keyword:hpCut"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至640% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至680% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至720% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至760% + 60% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","碎星之手"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯每第3次普通攻击额外造成高额伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯的每第3次普通攻击，投掷魔叉会附带魔力，造成210% + 30% ATK伤害，额外附带目标20% + 2%最大生命值的伤害（不超过240% + 30% ATK）。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":52,"end":57,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":73,"end":79,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":26,"end":40,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":69,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","基础伤害量提高至220% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","基础伤害量提高至230% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","基础伤害量提高至240% + 30% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","星云裂变"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯消耗生命值召唤使徒协助作战。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯消耗自身5%最大生命值，使用星云和粒子构造出2个持续12秒的使徒，使徒继承拉曼提斯45% + 6%的攻击力和80% + 8%的生命值，能使用普通攻击和碎星之手，并且优先攻击拉曼提斯当前攻击的目标。场上的使徒同时至多不超过6个。\n若使徒存活至持续时间结束，则使徒会重新融合到拉曼提斯身上，使拉曼提斯回复等同于使徒在存活期间实际造成伤害80%的生命值。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":53,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"},{"start":61,"end":66,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","使徒继承的攻击力比例提高至50% + 6%。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","使徒继承的攻击力比例提高至55% + 6%。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","使徒继承的攻击力比例提高至60% + 6%。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提高攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯和使徒提高20点攻击速度，场上每存在1名自己的使徒，攻击速度额外提高3点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯和使徒提高25点攻击速度，场上每存在1名自己的使徒，攻击速度额外提高4点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯和使徒提高30点攻击速度，场上每存在1名自己的使徒，攻击速度额外提高5点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","六眼观我"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","使徒释放普通攻击时提升基础属性，并在融回拉曼提斯时提供对应的增益。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使徒每次释放普通攻击时获得1层“成长”，每层“成长”提高4%基础属性。在使徒力量融合回拉曼提斯时，使拉曼提斯获得其身上的“成长”。拉曼提斯至多获得20层“成长”。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次成长提供的基础属性提高至5%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次成长提供的基础属性提高至6%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯通过该技能获得的“成长”达到上限后会睁开六眼，进入全盛姿态：在战斗中无需消耗地每间隔1秒生成使徒，直至达到上限。该状态下，拉曼提斯和使徒的“碎星之手”额外造成300% ATK真实伤害，使徒具备无限的持续时间，且拉曼提斯恢复相当于使徒实际造成伤害80%的生命值，及其获得能量的20%。进入全盛姿态后，拉曼提斯接下来6次普通攻击均替换为“碎星之手”。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":83,"end":91,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","拉曼提斯会获得使徒身上的部分增益效果。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","使徒受到其他友军提供的属性增益期间，额外使拉曼提斯也获得这部分10%的属性增益。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","流焰叉"]]}